WEBVTT

00:04.030 --> 00:05.590
Hitoe!

00:11.210 --> 00:12.409
That's horrible...

00:12.410 --> 00:17.349
I wish you could've seen Hitoe
getting all desperate and stuff.

00:17.350 --> 00:19.509
Like, she was saying she
was going to protect Ru-ru...

00:19.510 --> 00:21.549
Acting all cocky to me!

00:21.550 --> 00:22.520
Hitoe!

00:22.521 --> 00:26.689
Hey, once a nobody, always a nobody.

00:26.690 --> 00:30.250
If you want to battle me
that much, I'll battle you...!

00:31.760 --> 00:33.459
She's here!

00:33.460 --> 00:35.360
She came!

00:39.430 --> 00:42.530
I'm not part of the fun, am I?

00:45.140 --> 00:47.810
Lookie-lookie! Aki-lucky did
exactly what you asked for, Urith!

00:47.811 --> 00:48.979
Ru...

00:48.980 --> 00:50.879
Tama's here.
It was a piece of cake!

00:50.880 --> 00:54.779
Ruko came here with her buddy-buddy Iona.

00:54.780 --> 00:57.949
So Aki-lovely, right?

00:57.950 --> 01:01.059
Um, um, um, so Urith,
what should I do next?

01:01.060 --> 01:02.120
Aki-lu...

01:09.400 --> 01:13.130
Is this the interesting show you prepared?

01:16.100 --> 01:18.169
Urith...

01:18.170 --> 01:19.660
What a let down...

01:45.670 --> 01:47.169
<i>Taken and granted,</i>

01:47.170 --> 01:51.169
<i>ideals are repetitious
games that slip through</i>

01:51.170 --> 01:53.839
<i>My daily life is so shot with holes</i>

01:53.840 --> 01:56.709
<i>that I can barely stand</i>

01:56.710 --> 01:58.009
<i>Empty theories without conclusions</i>

01:58.010 --> 02:02.319
<i>Dance steps along invisible rules</i>

02:02.320 --> 02:07.319
<i>The final bell holding
together the crumbling day rings</i>

02:07.320 --> 02:11.729
<i>In the scene I imagine</i>

02:11.730 --> 02:14.359
<i>you're there</i>

02:14.360 --> 02:17.169
<i>with a smile</i>

02:17.170 --> 02:22.669
<i>No forgiveness? No desires?</i>

02:22.670 --> 02:26.130
<i>And still</i>

02:27.740 --> 02:30.979
<i>We cry "OPEN"</i>

02:30.980 --> 02:35.249
<i>A future to get back and a world to destroy</i>

02:35.250 --> 02:37.689
<i>A wish to open. GOT IT?</i>

02:37.690 --> 02:39.349
<i>Now cross</i>

02:39.350 --> 02:42.019
<i>I wish you don't cry</i>

02:42.020 --> 02:48.999
<i>The future of light and dark,
let's believe in the "future"</i>

02:49.000 --> 02:55.490
<i>so that they overlap to gain color again</i>

02:57.770 --> 02:59.430
What was that?

03:02.380 --> 03:04.710
I've never seen that before...

03:11.750 --> 03:14.359
Iona is the Girl of Dark.

03:14.360 --> 03:16.929
Tama is the Girl of Light.

03:16.930 --> 03:20.790
It's not possible for
dark to long for light.

03:22.130 --> 03:24.969
Is it because she went
to the outside world?

03:24.970 --> 03:27.440
Because she met Ru?

03:29.700 --> 03:31.069
Ru...

03:31.070 --> 03:34.379
may make their stories...

03:34.380 --> 03:36.870
more interesting.

03:42.320 --> 03:44.749
You brought them here?

03:44.750 --> 03:48.219
What would you have done if someone saw?

03:48.220 --> 03:49.759
I-I'm sorry!

03:49.760 --> 03:52.459
Urith! I'm sorry! Sorry!

03:52.460 --> 03:53.659
I'm so sorry...!

03:53.660 --> 03:54.899
Akira...

03:54.900 --> 03:57.069
Forgive me, please...

03:57.070 --> 03:59.329
Whoops, Aki-lucky got scolded!

03:59.330 --> 04:00.339
Shut up!

04:00.340 --> 04:02.439
Shut the hell up, bitch!

04:02.440 --> 04:04.769
Aww... So scary!

04:04.770 --> 04:06.269
Y-You know...?

04:06.270 --> 04:10.349
H-Hitoe... It's all Hitoe's fault!

04:10.350 --> 04:14.249
That ugly four-eyed girl
didn't have her LRIG card...

04:14.250 --> 04:16.989
B-But, see? Ruko is here with her...

04:16.990 --> 04:18.249
How unpleasant...

04:18.250 --> 04:19.350
Huh?

04:21.920 --> 04:23.929
What were you thinking?

04:23.930 --> 04:27.829
To scar her in such a noticeable place...

04:27.830 --> 04:29.759
Huh?

04:29.760 --> 04:31.299
How unsightly...

04:31.300 --> 04:32.699
Un...

04:32.700 --> 04:35.639
Un... sight... ly?

04:35.640 --> 04:37.000
Scar...

04:38.670 --> 04:40.610
Unsightly...

04:57.790 --> 05:02.290
Scars are best placed
where they can't be seen.

05:03.970 --> 05:06.969
Places like that...

05:06.970 --> 05:10.669
are softer, and easier to scar.

05:10.670 --> 05:12.140
Stop it!

05:13.410 --> 05:15.540
Get away from Hitoe!

05:22.880 --> 05:25.149
No need to be so afraid.

05:25.150 --> 05:27.319
It's not like I'm interested...

05:27.320 --> 05:31.090
No... not in a frail girl like you.

05:32.160 --> 05:35.499
Kominato Ruko and Iona...

05:35.500 --> 05:38.330
I want to battle you two.

05:40.570 --> 05:44.109
That's why I asked her to set a
stage that you couldn't refuse, but...

05:44.110 --> 05:47.679
Unsightly...
what tactless actions.

05:47.680 --> 05:50.709
Unsightly... Scar...
Such a foolish girl...

05:50.710 --> 05:53.179
You went through all this... But why?

05:53.180 --> 05:56.849
Unsightly... Unsightly...
I want to break you girls.

05:56.850 --> 05:58.349
Break...?

05:58.350 --> 06:00.759
Unsightly...
Things of beauty...

06:00.760 --> 06:02.689
Things of power...

06:02.690 --> 06:04.459
Things of splendor...

06:04.460 --> 06:06.229
Things of justice...

06:06.230 --> 06:10.030
I love seeing them being broken.

06:11.130 --> 06:16.399
All things are most brilliant
when they're being broken.

06:16.400 --> 06:18.460
Don't you think so?

06:22.610 --> 06:25.480
It started off small.

06:27.920 --> 06:31.040
I kept breaking various things.

06:33.150 --> 06:37.110
They went cold in my hands...

06:38.790 --> 06:42.629
When I was young, I was able
to deceive the adults around me.

06:42.630 --> 06:45.100
But that didn't last very long.

06:51.240 --> 06:55.079
Then it struck me that it's
fine as long as no one finds out.

06:55.080 --> 06:59.109
All I need to do is leave a
scar where it can't be seen.

06:59.110 --> 07:02.449
That way, no one will
say anything about it.

07:02.450 --> 07:07.089
The softest place that can't
be seen from the outside...

07:07.090 --> 07:09.019
The heart...

07:09.020 --> 07:09.690
Hitoe!

07:09.691 --> 07:11.259
Why you...! Stop!

07:11.260 --> 07:12.959
I won't do anything.

07:12.960 --> 07:18.490
It's not my taste to act crudely,
inflicting pain to someone directly.

07:20.000 --> 07:25.339
I just lead people to hate themselves.

07:25.340 --> 07:31.180
To hate their lives to the extent
that they end their lives themselves...

07:33.780 --> 07:36.319
But, I failed.

07:36.320 --> 07:37.989
A mistake led to discovery...

07:37.990 --> 07:40.719
and so I had to behave myself.

07:40.720 --> 07:43.690
I acted like a good girl, and made friends.

07:46.360 --> 07:50.899
I just had to break someone.

07:50.900 --> 07:55.300
The boredom was so great that
I was the one who felt like dying.

07:59.910 --> 08:01.540
But then...

08:03.740 --> 08:05.340
I met...

08:08.750 --> 08:10.819
an LRIG.

08:10.820 --> 08:11.750
Tama!

08:11.751 --> 08:14.919
Being a Selector is wonderful!

08:14.920 --> 08:20.189
There's no need to worry
about others in the battlefield.

08:20.190 --> 08:24.169
You're free to hurt anyone
as much as you want.

08:24.170 --> 08:27.070
Neither adults nor law have any relevance.

08:29.200 --> 08:32.269
I broke everyone to my heart's content.

08:32.270 --> 08:35.870
Stepping on the wishes of
others, to make them lose hope...

08:38.110 --> 08:40.450
and their spirit.

08:42.550 --> 08:44.889
Even now...

08:44.890 --> 08:48.619
I can hear the girls' cries.

08:48.620 --> 08:50.219
Disgusting...

08:50.220 --> 08:53.459
Was that your wish...?

08:53.460 --> 08:56.629
To bring other people's lives to ruin?!

08:56.630 --> 08:57.969
No...

08:57.970 --> 09:01.139
I wanted to be within this...

09:01.140 --> 09:06.239
Within this vortex of
sorrow, hate, and regret.

09:06.240 --> 09:09.700
That's why I wished to be an LRIG.

09:12.910 --> 09:16.649
Really? Can I really become an LRIG?

09:16.650 --> 09:21.989
Yes. A Selector deserving
of you lies in wait.

09:21.990 --> 09:23.790
And...

09:30.000 --> 09:34.900
that appearance of
yours is fitting beside her.

09:37.470 --> 09:40.930
And so, you came to me.

09:43.410 --> 09:48.080
Well, you were a bit
too refined for my tastes.

09:50.520 --> 09:54.459
Say, has this ever crossed your mind?

09:54.460 --> 09:57.650
That the real world can just bite the dust.

09:59.030 --> 10:00.799
There's nothing here but...

10:00.800 --> 10:06.999
false images, deceit,
and pretentious lies.

10:07.000 --> 10:10.269
But, the battlefield isn't like that.

10:10.270 --> 10:12.639
There is only truth there.

10:12.640 --> 10:18.279
Unsheathed battling for
one's desire, one's wish...

10:18.280 --> 10:22.980
And... Splattered hearts lay in ruin.

10:25.720 --> 10:28.519
I want to watch forever...

10:28.520 --> 10:30.829
the despair.

10:30.830 --> 10:34.899
That's why I'll continue
to win my battles, and...

10:34.900 --> 10:37.830
repeat being an LRIG, forevermore!

10:40.570 --> 10:43.239
Now, let's battle!

10:43.240 --> 10:45.739
Iona, you want to do it too, right?

10:45.740 --> 10:48.909
That is why you became Ru's LRIG after all.

10:48.910 --> 10:50.749
Kominato Ruko.

10:50.750 --> 10:54.249
You're the greatest
Selector I have ever met.

10:54.250 --> 10:59.219
What sound will come
from shattering your heart?

10:59.220 --> 11:02.659
What kind of cries will you let out?

11:02.660 --> 11:04.159
No!

11:04.160 --> 11:06.489
No, Ruko!

11:06.490 --> 11:11.829
It's not my taste, but I
didn't say I can't break you.

11:11.830 --> 11:12.770
Stop!

11:12.771 --> 11:14.099
Let's do this, Ruko.

11:14.100 --> 11:14.940
Iona...

11:14.941 --> 11:18.439
She's serious. There's no
telling what she'll do if you refuse.

11:18.440 --> 11:19.539
Iona!

11:19.540 --> 11:22.279
You want to save Hitoe, right?

11:22.280 --> 11:25.250
Ruko, don't worry about me.

11:26.350 --> 11:27.610
Ru!

11:37.220 --> 11:40.089
If I win, let Hitoe go.

11:40.090 --> 11:42.429
No! Ruko!

11:42.430 --> 11:45.029
That's "if" you win...

11:45.030 --> 11:46.699
Let's go, Iona!

11:46.700 --> 11:47.760
Yes.

11:50.710 --> 11:54.709
Ru... Such straightforward
and beautiful eyes...

11:54.710 --> 11:58.370
I'll carve despair into
those eyes of yours!

11:59.710 --> 12:00.880
Open!

12:25.610 --> 12:27.609
Iona...

12:27.610 --> 12:30.810
Tama... and...

12:32.950 --> 12:34.510
Ru...

12:51.600 --> 12:53.599
Hello, Kominato speaking.

12:53.600 --> 12:56.939
Ah, Uemura-<i>san</i>. I appreciate
you for having Ruko...

12:56.940 --> 12:59.169
What? Hitoe-<i>chan</i> hasn't returned?

12:59.170 --> 13:01.270
She's not answering your calls?

13:07.480 --> 13:09.349
Now, let's begin.

13:09.350 --> 13:11.820
Tama... Grow!

13:14.120 --> 13:15.450
Grow!

13:18.490 --> 13:20.799
Unsightly...

13:20.800 --> 13:22.130
Urie!

13:25.230 --> 13:26.369
Tama-<i>chan...</i>

13:26.370 --> 13:29.139
Wow! Super!

13:29.140 --> 13:31.469
Urith...

13:31.470 --> 13:33.570
Here I go, Tama...!

13:35.080 --> 13:37.810
Iona-<i>san</i>! Death Beam!

13:44.320 --> 13:47.389
As expected, Ru...

13:47.390 --> 13:51.229
Breaking you is going to be well worth it!

13:51.230 --> 13:53.489
Skyju, attack!

13:53.490 --> 13:55.860
Burst! No Gain!

13:59.330 --> 14:01.169
Ruko...

14:01.170 --> 14:02.100
Tama...

14:02.101 --> 14:04.909
They're both battling seriously?

14:04.910 --> 14:07.369
Looks like Urith's having fun!

14:07.370 --> 14:09.079
Isn't that right, Aki-lucky?

14:09.080 --> 14:10.539
No...
Hm?

14:10.540 --> 14:12.449
Urith...

14:12.450 --> 14:14.549
My Urith...!

14:14.550 --> 14:16.519
I feel it again...

14:16.520 --> 14:17.749
Ru is entering my body...

14:17.750 --> 14:18.750
"Black Crisis"

14:19.550 --> 14:23.859
Light... is spreading within me...

14:23.860 --> 14:26.389
So you are serious, Ru...

14:26.390 --> 14:28.190
You're seriously...

14:30.700 --> 14:33.229
Ru... Tama knows, too.

14:33.230 --> 14:35.569
Tama has the same feelings as Ru.

14:35.570 --> 14:38.239
Stop, Tama-<i>chan</i>! Ruko!

14:38.240 --> 14:40.239
I want to save Hitoe...

14:40.240 --> 14:42.939
To do that, I have to win!

14:42.940 --> 14:44.410
"Servant One"

14:44.411 --> 14:46.409
Ruko... For that, you'll
even sacrifice Tama...

14:46.410 --> 14:48.779
I'm sorry, Tama!

14:48.780 --> 14:50.119
Ru...

14:50.120 --> 14:52.289
Tama understands...

14:52.290 --> 14:54.280
I understand...

14:56.760 --> 14:58.759
Ruko...

14:58.760 --> 14:59.590
Tama...

14:59.591 --> 15:00.999
Please stop!

15:01.000 --> 15:04.829
I don't want to see Ruko and
Tama-<i>chan</i> hurting each other!

15:04.830 --> 15:06.929
Thank you, Hitoe.

15:06.930 --> 15:09.599
Tama likes Hitoe a lot, too.

15:09.600 --> 15:11.070
That's why...

15:13.610 --> 15:16.080
I'll battle... serious!

15:18.610 --> 15:20.340
Vimana, attack!

15:29.820 --> 15:31.310
Tama...!

15:33.490 --> 15:34.629
I'm sorry...

15:34.630 --> 15:35.929
I'm so sorry.

15:35.930 --> 15:38.529
It's all because I was caught.

15:38.530 --> 15:42.599
I'm the reason why Ruko
and Tama-<i>chan</i> are...

15:42.600 --> 15:44.200
Hitoe!

15:46.110 --> 15:48.709
Don't look away!

15:48.710 --> 15:50.270
Yuzuki...

15:53.050 --> 15:55.380
We can't do anything...

15:58.450 --> 16:02.220
All we can do is watch...

16:05.360 --> 16:07.659
But...

16:07.660 --> 16:09.859
that's why...

16:09.860 --> 16:12.630
we shouldn't look away!

16:17.740 --> 16:21.409
Such a beautiful style of battle...

16:21.410 --> 16:25.049
She really is great.

16:25.050 --> 16:29.319
I can see why you laid eyes on her, Iona.

16:29.320 --> 16:34.589
I won't let you savor something
this amazing yourself...

16:34.590 --> 16:36.989
You and me... No...

16:36.990 --> 16:41.229
Let's savor this in full, along with Ru...

16:41.230 --> 16:47.600
I'll love you with pain until
you raise a sweet shriek, Ru!

16:53.370 --> 16:55.839
I've never seen...

16:55.840 --> 16:59.049
Urith so happy before...

16:59.050 --> 17:02.779
I've... never seen...

17:02.780 --> 17:04.950
How unsightly...

17:10.720 --> 17:15.299
Un... Un... sightly...

17:15.300 --> 17:17.460
Unsightly...

17:18.970 --> 17:20.960
Things of beauty...

17:22.640 --> 17:24.709
N-No...

17:24.710 --> 17:26.369
Urith...

17:26.370 --> 17:28.639
loves me...

17:28.640 --> 17:31.779
She... loves me...

17:31.780 --> 17:34.279
Akira is Urith's Aki-lovely...

17:34.280 --> 17:35.779
Aki-lovely...

17:35.780 --> 17:38.089
Aki-lovely... Aki-lovely...

17:38.090 --> 17:40.650
Tama! Arc Aura!

17:47.260 --> 17:49.250
Iona, are you okay?!

17:53.830 --> 17:55.439
Hurry...

17:55.440 --> 17:57.670
The battle isn't over yet!

17:58.670 --> 18:00.169
Ener Charge!

18:00.170 --> 18:02.179
Hurry...!

18:02.180 --> 18:04.079
Ru! Iona!

18:04.080 --> 18:06.479
Please hurry!

18:06.480 --> 18:09.849
Hurry and beat Tama!

18:09.850 --> 18:12.489
Please...!

18:12.490 --> 18:14.459
Tama...

18:14.460 --> 18:16.360
Tama-<i>chan...</i>

18:18.130 --> 18:19.789
Sorry...

18:19.790 --> 18:21.859
I'm sorry...

18:21.860 --> 18:23.330
Tama...

18:25.600 --> 18:26.929
Iona...

18:26.930 --> 18:28.370
Grow.

18:32.810 --> 18:35.809
Everything is shining in white...

18:35.810 --> 18:37.370
It's so bright...

18:40.880 --> 18:44.819
That strange thing is happening again.

18:44.820 --> 18:48.120
Dark crossing with light...?

18:49.790 --> 18:51.329
So...

18:51.330 --> 18:54.120
Ru is making things
interesting after all.

19:09.480 --> 19:11.649
Level 5?!

19:11.650 --> 19:13.249
Color Milulun surprised!

19:13.250 --> 19:14.479
lovely...

19:14.480 --> 19:15.649
Aki-lovely...

19:15.650 --> 19:17.919
Aki... lovely...

19:17.920 --> 19:19.680
Dark Matter!

19:29.830 --> 19:31.590
Yikes!

19:36.840 --> 19:38.200
Tama...

19:41.180 --> 19:43.009
Baroque Defense!

19:43.010 --> 19:45.179
Milulun knows that-lun!

19:45.180 --> 19:48.910
It can negate any attack, right?

19:54.390 --> 19:56.020
Tama!

19:57.220 --> 19:59.389
So...

19:59.390 --> 20:05.599
So... strong. Ru... Iona...

20:05.600 --> 20:10.399
Tama... might lose...

20:10.400 --> 20:11.900
But...

20:13.810 --> 20:16.640
Hitoe's... going to be saved...

20:17.710 --> 20:19.379
Tama...

20:19.380 --> 20:21.779
As I thought...

20:21.780 --> 20:24.450
Tama... is light...

20:27.220 --> 20:30.160
There once was a certain girl.

20:31.930 --> 20:37.760
She was in solitude from the
moment she was born into this world.

20:40.770 --> 20:43.499
She didn't know the world outside...

20:43.500 --> 20:48.479
and was neither loved
nor touched by anyone.

20:48.480 --> 20:54.850
Ever and ever, she lived a life in
solitude that felt like an eternity.

21:01.690 --> 21:04.789
Do you remember Futase Fumio's story?

21:04.790 --> 21:10.629
The girls of dark and light
were originally from one girl.

21:10.630 --> 21:12.529
She's...

21:12.530 --> 21:15.439
the original girl.

21:15.440 --> 21:18.439
And... She's...

21:18.440 --> 21:20.809
Mayu is...

21:20.810 --> 21:22.830
our mother.

21:26.210 --> 21:28.010
So bad...

21:31.820 --> 21:33.050
Iona!

21:39.490 --> 21:42.690
Just when everyone was having fun...

21:44.830 --> 21:48.369
you had to make everyone feel terrible.

21:48.370 --> 21:50.569
Iona is a bad girl.

21:50.570 --> 21:52.539
She brings misery...

21:52.540 --> 21:55.970
"That Lie a Scar"

21:53.040 --> 21:55.210
as the Girl of Dark.

22:02.380 --> 22:03.879
<i>Life...</i>

22:03.880 --> 22:09.319
<i>A city of mazes with no exit</i>

22:09.320 --> 22:13.859
<i>and the sound of bells ringing</i>

22:13.860 --> 22:15.429
<i>I do...</i>

22:15.430 --> 22:21.029
<i>Leave the "now" handed to me</i>

22:21.030 --> 22:25.739
<i>as I begin to walk in the morning</i>

22:25.740 --> 22:31.209
<i>In a world where light and dark intersect</i>

22:31.210 --> 22:37.379
<i>catharsis begins to awake</i>

22:37.380 --> 22:42.519
<i>I swore in my shaking heart</i>

22:42.520 --> 22:50.520
<i>that I won't lose anyone anymore...!</i>

22:54.230 --> 22:59.309
<i>Even if my tears flow tomorrow</i>

22:59.310 --> 23:06.049
<i>I'll run through the wind</i>

23:06.050 --> 23:11.049
<i>Release myself towards
the future I selected</i>

23:11.050 --> 23:13.719
<i>to regain it</i>

23:13.720 --> 23:20.790
<i>I won't give up on my wish</i>

23:26.800 --> 23:28.939
Ru entered me...

23:28.940 --> 23:31.299
It felt nice and warm...

23:31.300 --> 23:33.309
Frie... nd...

